<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers were moderately active. Compared with last week's close, both classes were steady to $0.50 lower.</p>
<p>Steers - part load choice predominantly 3 Blacks near 1325</p>
<p>lbs 67.50. High select and choice 2-3 1200-1350 lbs</p>
<p>64.00-66.00. Select and choice 2-3 1100-1300 lbs 61.00-64.00.</p>
<p>Select 1-2 58.00-61.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - load choice predominantly 3 near 1300 lbs 66.25.</p>
<p>High select and choice 2-3 1050-1200 lbs 63.00-65.50. Select</p>
<p>and choice 2-3 1000-1125 lbs 60.00-63.00. Select 1-2</p>
<p>58.00-60.00.</p>
</text>
